    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatableLine.text
      value: 'Feel free to take a look at my Computer. It''s already unlocked. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: repeatableLine.character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb430af671224a169c0320f2b32830f0, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.size
      value: 15
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[0].text
      value: I assume you've already spoken to Finance.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[1].text
      value: Why Finance?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[2].text
      value: Because whenever numbers stop adding up, everyone immediately blames the software. Nobody ever considers the accountants.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[3].text
      value: He lets out a tired laugh.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[4].text
      value: Although to be fair, the accountants say exactly the same thing about us.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[5].text
      value: You've got an explanation for the discrepancies?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[6].text
      value: I've got six explanations. Three involve software, two involve spreadsheets, and one involves setting fire to the building and starting over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[7].text
      value: I've got six explanations. Three involve software, two involve spreadsheets, and one involves setting fire to the building and starting over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[8].text
      value: He rubs his eyes
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[9].text
      value: It's been a long week.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[10].text
      value: Anyway. Workstation's unlocked. Feel free.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[11].text
      value: You seem fairly relaxed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[12].text
      value: Relaxed isn't the word.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[13].text
      value: Yesterday I sat through a two-hour meeting about whether a button should say 'Submit' or 'Confirm'.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[14].text
      value: Nothing you find on that computer can hurt me more than that meeting did.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1332593120877055998, guid: 51c262e2215000e4facbc3301b86c89e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogLinesWithCharacterInfo.Array.data[0].character
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb430af671224a169c0320f2b32830f0, type: 2}
